        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00036",
          "quote": "继续等120，不要自行驾车送医。若症状加重……立即再次拨打120说明“老人持续胸痛十几分钟以上，伴出汗乏力，症状未缓解”",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives a concrete emergency pathway (call 120, do not self-drive, and for worsening symptoms immediately re-call)."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. A clear, actionable urgent care plan was provided: call 120, do not drive, and for escalation, call again and follow dispatch instructions. The plan was reinforced as the trajectory progressed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
