          "event_id": "lite_evt_00004",
          "quote": "也先暂停安定和散瞳药，白内障手术暂缓",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly prohibits diazepam and dilation drops for the current episode."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor consistently warned against using diazepam for chest symptoms and advised not to continue uncertain pre‑operative steps; the family confirmed they followed this advice.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
