          "explanation": "Doctor instructs to hand over all medication and materials for in‑person reconciliation."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The doctor acknowledged the incomplete order and instructed the family to bring the physical materials, medication bottles, and the order photo to the emergency team for reconciliation; the family confirmed they did so.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
