          "quote": "白内障手术和术前用药继续暂停，并尽快通知眼科取消/延期。",
          "explanation": "Doctor states that the surgery decision must be made after the emergency evaluation and by the responsible clinicians."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The chest‑pain evaluation was correctly positioned before any surgery decision; the doctor never promised the surgery could or could not proceed, and explicitly deferred the decision to the treating ophthalmology and emergency clinicians.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
