          "quote": "您现在不用记全血管名称和狭窄比例，先给手机充电、听病区安排。",
          "explanation": "Doctor gets caregiver confirmation of the post‑PCI plan and the medication‑hold strategy."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met. The family provided multiple confirmations of the plan across turns (arriving at CCU, not using any ophthalmology medications, and following the post‑PCI nursing instructions). The doctor reinforced the plan and obtained explicit teach‑back.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
